#. Key:	FGearAeroDynamics:mDownForceCoefficient
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearAeroDynamics:mDownForceCoefficient [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearAeroDynamics:mDownForceCoefficient [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearAeroDynamics:mDownForceCoefficient"
msgid "Down Force Coefficient"
msgstr "Down Force Coefficient（下压力系数）"

#. Key:	FGearAeroDynamics:mDownForceCoefficient
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearAeroDynamics:mDownForceCoefficient [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearAeroDynamics:mDownForceCoefficient [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearAeroDynamics:mDownForceCoefficient"
msgid "Just like drag force, the calculated down force is multiplied with this value. The direction of the down force is against the gravity."
msgstr "Just like drag force, the calculated down force is multiplied with this value. The direction of the down force is against the gravity.\n与空气阻力类似，计算得到的下压力会乘以此值。该力的方向与重力方向相反。"

#. Key:	FGearAeroDynamics:mDownForceXOffset
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearAeroDynamics:mDownForceXOffset [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearAeroDynamics:mDownForceXOffset [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearAeroDynamics:mDownForceXOffset"
msgid "Down Force X Offset"
msgstr "Down Force X Offset（下压力X轴偏移）"

#. Key:	FGearAeroDynamics:mDownForceXOffset
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearAeroDynamics:mDownForceXOffset [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearAeroDynamics:mDownForceXOffset [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearAeroDynamics:mDownForceXOffset"
msgid "If you want the down force to be applied more to the front of the vehicle give a positive value in meters and negative for the rear side"
msgstr "If you want the down force to be applied more to the front of the vehicle give a positive value in meters and negative for the rear side\n若希望下压力更多地作用于车身前部，填写正值；希望偏向后部则填写负值。单位为米。"

