#. Key:	FGearAeroDynamics:mDragCoefficient
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearAeroDynamics:mDragCoefficient [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearAeroDynamics:mDragCoefficient [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearAeroDynamics:mDragCoefficient"
msgid "Drag Coefficient"
msgstr "Drag Coefficient（阻力系数）"

#. Key:	FGearAeroDynamics:mDragCoefficient
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearAeroDynamics:mDragCoefficient [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearAeroDynamics:mDragCoefficient [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearAeroDynamics:mDragCoefficient"
msgid "Aero drag is calculated using a unit area factor, vehicle speed and air density constant. This value is multiplied with the result of this calculation. The direction of the force is always the opposite of vehicles velocity."
msgstr "Aero drag is calculated using a unit area factor, vehicle speed and air density constant. This value is multiplied with the result of this calculation. The direction of the force is always the opposite of vehicles velocity.\n空气阻力根据单位面积因子、载具速度和空气密度常数计算，再乘以此值。阻力方向始终与载具速度方向相反。"

