#. Key:	FGearAxle:mAckermanCoeff
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearAxle:mAckermanCoeff [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearAxle:mAckermanCoeff [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearAxle:mAckermanCoeff"
msgid "Ackerman Coefficient"
msgstr "Ackerman Coefficient（阿克曼系数）"

#. Key:	FGearAxle:mAckermanCoeff
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearAxle:mAckermanCoeff [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearAxle:mAckermanCoeff [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearAxle:mAckermanCoeff"
msgid "Ackerman steering values are automatically calculated from this axle and the reference axle. This value determines the rate this calculation is applied. Providing negative values for anti ackerman is also possible."
msgstr "Ackerman steering values are automatically calculated from this axle and the reference axle. This value determines the rate this calculation is applied. Providing negative values for anti ackerman is also possible.\n阿克曼转向值会根据当前车轴和参考车轴自动计算。此值决定计算结果的应用比例，也可以使用负值实现反阿克曼转向。"

#. Key:	FGearAxle:mAckermanReferenceIndex
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearAxle:mAckermanReferenceIndex [IntProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearAxle:mAckermanReferenceIndex [IntProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearAxle:mAckermanReferenceIndex"
msgid "Ackerman Reference Axle"
msgstr "Ackerman Reference Axle（阿克曼参考车轴）"

#. Key:	FGearAxle:mAckermanReferenceIndex
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearAxle:mAckermanReferenceIndex [IntProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearAxle:mAckermanReferenceIndex [IntProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearAxle:mAckermanReferenceIndex"
msgid "Ackerman calculation is based on the current axle and the axle that is referenced by this index value. Normally this value is the index of the rear axle"
msgstr "Ackerman calculation is based on the current axle and the axle that is referenced by this index value. Normally this value is the index of the rear axle\n阿克曼转向计算基于当前车轴，以及此索引指定的参考车轴。通常该值应为后车轴的索引。"

#. Key:	FGearAxle:mCamberAngle
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearAxle:mCamberAngle [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearAxle:mCamberAngle [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearAxle:mCamberAngle"
msgid "Camber Angle"
msgstr "Camber Angle（外倾角）"

#. Key:	FGearAxle:mCamberAngle
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearAxle:mCamberAngle [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearAxle:mCamberAngle [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearAxle:mCamberAngle"
msgid "Camber angle value in degrees. This value visually changes the wheels roll angle and is fed to the tire model"
msgstr "Camber angle value in degrees. This value visually changes the wheels roll angle and is fed to the tire model\n外倾角，单位为度。此值会在视觉上改变车轮的滚转角，并传入轮胎模型。"

#. Key:	FGearAxle
