msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearAxle:mDifferentialType"
msgid "Differential Type"
msgstr "Differential Type（差速器类型）"

#. Key:	FGearAxle:mDifferentialType
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearAxle:mDifferentialType [EnumProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearAxle:mDifferentialType [EnumProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearAxle:mDifferentialType"
msgid "Currently open, locked and lsd differentials are supported."
msgstr "Currently open, locked and lsd differentials are supported.\n目前支持开放式、锁止式和限滑式（LSD）差速器。"

#. Key:	FGearAxle:mDiffStrength
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearAxle:mDiffStrength [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearAxle:mDiffStrength [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearAxle:mDiffStrength"
msgid "Differential Strength"
msgstr "Differential Strength（差速器强度）"

#. Key:	FGearAxle:mDiffStrength
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearAxle:mDiffStrength [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearAxle:mDiffStrength [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearAxle:mDiffStrength"
msgid "This parameter is only visible if lsd type is selected and determines the magnitude of the extra force that is applied to the gripping wheel"
msgstr "This parameter is only visible if lsd type is selected and determines the magnitude of the extra force that is applied to the gripping wheel\n仅在选择 LSD 限滑差速器时可见，用于决定施加到有抓地力车轮上的额外力大小。"

#. Key:	FGearAxle:mFinalGearRatio
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearAxle:mFinalGearRatio [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearAxle:mFinalGearRatio [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearAxle:mFinalGearRatio"
msgid "Final Gear Ratio"
msgstr "Final Gear Ratio（最终传动比）"

#. Key:	FGearAxle:mFinalGearRatio
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearAxle:mFinalGearRatio [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearAxle:mFinalGearRatio [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearAxle:mFinalGearRatio"
msgid "The transmission value is calculated from the current gear ratio and this final gear ratio(also called final drive). In real cars this is the gear ratio between the the driveshaft and the axle which can determine the acceleration and the top speed of the vehicle. Higher values result faster accelerations and lower top speeds."
msgstr "The transmission value is calculated from the current gear ratio and this final gear ratio(also called final drive). In real cars this is the gear ratio between the the driveshaft and the axle which can determine the acceleration and the top speed of the vehicle. Higher values result faster accelerations and lower top speeds.\n总传动比根据当前挡位齿比和此最终传动比（又称主减速比）计算。在真实车辆中，这是传动轴与车轴之间的齿比，可决定载具的加速能力和最高速度。数值越大，加速越快，但最高速度越低。"

#. Key:	FGearAxle:mHasHandbrake
