msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearAxle:mMaxSteerAngle"
msgid "Maximum angle(degree) of steering for this axles wheels. For non steering wheels just leave it at 0."
msgstr "Maximum angle(degree) of steering for this axles wheels. For non steering wheels just leave it at 0.\n此车轴车轮的最大转向角，单位为度。非转向车轮保持为 0 即可。"

#. Key:	FGearAxle:mToeAngle
