msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearAxle:mToeAngle"
msgid "Toe angle value in degrees. This value visually change the wheels yaw angle and modifies the direction of the force output of the wheel."
msgstr "Toe angle value in degrees. This value visually change the wheels yaw angle and modifies the direction of the force output of the wheel.\n前束角，单位为度。此值会在视觉上改变车轮的偏航角，并改变车轮输出力的方向。"

#. Key:	FGearAxle:mTorqueShare
