#. Key:	FGearEngine:mEngineInertia
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearEngine:mEngineInertia [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearEngine:mEngineInertia [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearEngine:mEngineInertia"
msgid "Engine Inertia"
msgstr "Engine Inertia（发动机惯量）"

#. Key:	FGearEngine:mEngineInertia
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearEngine:mEngineInertia [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearEngine:mEngineInertia [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearEngine:mEngineInertia"
msgid "This effects the acceleration/deceleration of the engine. Inertia has direct effect on the acceleration of the vehicle so avoid too low or high values. To determine a good value you can rev up/down in neutral gear and see how it behaves"
msgstr "This effects the acceleration/deceleration of the engine. Inertia has direct effect on the acceleration of the vehicle so avoid too low or high values. To determine a good value you can rev up/down in neutral gear and see how it behaves\n影响发动机的加速与减速。惯量直接影响载具的加速能力，因此应避免过低或过高。可在空挡下升降转速，观察表现以确定合适的数值。"

#. Key:	FGearEngine:mEngineStallRpm
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearEngine:mEngineStallRpm [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearEngine:mEngineStallRpm [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearEngine:mEngineStallRpm"
msgid "Engine Stall Rpm"
msgstr "Engine Stall Rpm（发动机熄火转速）"

#. Key:	FGearEngine:mEngineStallRpm
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearEngine:mEngineStallRpm [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearEngine:mEngineStallRpm [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearEngine:mEngineStallRpm"
msgid "Engine is considered to be stalling when the current rpm falls below this value."
msgstr "Engine is considered to be stalling when the current rpm falls below this value.\n当前发动机转速低于此值时，视为进入熄火判定状态。"

#. Key:	FGearEngine:mEngineStallTime
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearEngine:mEngineStallTime [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearEngine:mEngineStallTime [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearEngine:mEngineStallTime"
msgid "Engine Stall Duration"
msgstr "Engine Stall Duration（发动机熄火持续时间）"

#. Key:	FGearEngine:mEngineStallTime
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearEngine:mEngineStallTime [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearEngine:mEngineStallTime [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearEngine:mEngineStallTime"
msgid "If the engine keeps stalling this amount of time(in seconds) then the engine is forced to stop. The engine won't stall if this value is negative."
msgstr "If the engine keeps stalling this amount of time(in seconds) then the engine is forced to stop. The engine won't stall if this value is negative.\n发动机持续处于熄火判定状态达到此时间（单位：秒）后，会被强制停止。设为负值时，发动机不会熄火。"

#. Key:	FGearEngine:mFrictionTorque
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearEngine:mFrictionTorque [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearEngine:mFrictionTorque [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearEngine:mFrictionTorque"
msgid "Friction Torque"
msgstr "Friction Torque（摩擦扭矩）"

#. Key:	FGearEngine:mFrictionTorque
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearEngine:mFrictionTorque [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearEngine:mFrictionTorque [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearEngine:mFrictionTorque"
msgid "This is a constant friction factor(multiplied with rpm) that slows down the engine. Higher values result more engine brake and faster rpm rev downs. Lower values has opposite effect so to determine a good value you can rev up in neutral gear and see how it revs down."
msgstr "This is a constant friction factor(multiplied with rpm) that slows down the engine. Higher values result more engine brake and faster rpm rev downs. Lower values has opposite effect so to determine a good value you can rev up in neutral gear and see how it revs down.\n使发动机减速的恒定摩擦系数，实际作用与转速相乘。数值越大，发动机制动越强，转速下降越快；数值较小则相反。可在空挡下提高转速，再观察转速回落过程来确定合适值。"

#. Key:	FGearEngine:mIdleRpm
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearEngine:mIdleRpm [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearEngine:mIdleRpm [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearEngine:mIdleRpm"
msgid "Idle Rpm"
msgstr "Idle Rpm（怠速）"

#. Key:	FGearEngine:mIdleRpm
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearEngine:mIdleRpm [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearEngine:mIdleRpm [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearEngine:mIdleRpm"
msgid "Minumum rpm value of the engine, currently there is no stalling so the engine always keeps revving"
msgstr "Minumum rpm value of the engine, currently there is no stalling so the engine always keeps revving\n发动机的最低转速。当前没有熄火，因此发动机会始终保持运转。"

#. Key:	FGearEngine:mLimiterTime
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearEngine:mLimiterTime [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearEngine:mLimiterTime [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearEngine:mLimiterTime"
msgid "Limiter Time"
msgstr "Limiter Time（限制器时间）"

#. Key:	FGearEngine:mLimiterTime
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearEngine:mLimiterTime [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearEngine:mLimiterTime [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearEngine:mLimiterTime"
msgid "When the rpm value reaches the limit value the throttle input is blocked for this long. It is measured in miliseconds. Experiment with it but keep in mind that if the engine inertia is too low, engine rpm will fluctuate a lot so you better keep it as low as possible"
msgstr "When the rpm value reaches the limit value the throttle input is blocked for this long. It is measured in miliseconds. Experiment with it but keep in mind that if the engine inertia is too low, engine rpm will fluctuate a lot so you better keep it as low as possible\n发动机转速达到限制值后，油门输入被阻断的持续时间，单位为毫秒。可试验调整，但发动机惯量过低时转速会剧烈波动，因此最好让此值尽量小。"

#. Key:	FGearEngine:mLimitRpm
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearEngine:mLimitRpm [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearEngine:mLimitRpm [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearEngine:mLimitRpm"
msgid "Limit Rpm"
msgstr "Limit Rpm（限制转速）"

#. Key:	FGearEngine:mLimitRpm
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearEngine:mLimitRpm [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearEngine:mLimitRpm [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearEngine:mLimitRpm"
msgid "This is the maximum rpm that the engine can rev up to, after this point engine input is blocked for a little time, see limiter time."
msgstr "This is the maximum rpm that the engine can rev up to, after this point engine input is blocked for a little time, see limiter time.\n发动机可达到的最高转速。达到此值后，发动机输入会被短暂阻断，持续时间参见“Limiter Time（限制器时间）”。"

#. Key:	FGearEngine
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearEngine:mTorqueCurve [ObjectProperty Category meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearEngine:mTorqueCurve [ObjectProperty Category meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectCategory,FGearEngine"
msgid "FGearEngine"
msgstr "FGearEngine（发动机）"

#. Key:	FGearEngine:mTorqueCurve
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearEngine:mTorqueCurve [ObjectProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearEngine:mTorqueCurve [ObjectProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearEngine:mTorqueCurve"
msgid "Torque Curve"
msgstr "Torque Curve（扭矩曲线）"

#. Key:	FGearEngine:mTorqueCurve
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearEngine:mTorqueCurve [ObjectProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearEngine:mTorqueCurve [ObjectProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearEngine:mTorqueCurve"
msgid "The engine torque is directly the result of this curve. The X axis of the curve represents engine rpm and Y axis is the torque value in Nm. There are real world vehicles engine curves available on the internet, mimicking those curves is a good way to start."
msgstr "The engine torque is directly the result of this curve. The X axis of the curve represents engine rpm and Y axis is the torque value in Nm. There are real world vehicles engine curves available on the internet, mimicking those curves is a good way to start.\n发动机扭矩直接由此曲线决定。曲线 X 轴表示发动机转速，Y 轴表示扭矩，单位为 N·m。网上可以找到真实载具的发动机曲线，仿照这些曲线是不错的起点。"

#. Key:	FGearEngine:mTorqueScale
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearEngine:mTorqueScale [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearEngine:mTorqueScale [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearEngine:mTorqueScale"
msgid "Torque Scale"
msgstr "Torque Scale（扭矩缩放）"

#. Key:	FGearEngine:mTorqueScale
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearEngine:mTorqueScale [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearEngine:mTorqueScale [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearEngine:mTorqueScale"
msgid "This is the direct multiplier of engine torque curve. Final engine torque is : Curve Result x Scale."
msgstr "This is the direct multiplier of engine torque curve. Final engine torque is : Curve Result x Scale.\n发动机扭矩曲线的直接乘数。最终发动机扭矩 = 曲线结果 × 缩放值。"

