msgid "Brake Action"
msgstr "Brake Action（制动输入动作）"

#. Key:	FGearStandardInput:mBrakeAction
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mBrakeAction [ObjectProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mBrakeAction [ObjectProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearStandardInput:mBrakeAction"
msgid "Input action that corresponds to mBrakeAxis."
msgstr "Input action that corresponds to mBrakeAxis.\n对应 mBrakeAxis 的输入动作。"

#. Key:	FGearStandardInput:mBrakeAxis
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mBrakeAxis [NameProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mBrakeAxis [NameProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearStandardInput:mBrakeAxis"
msgid "Brake Axis"
msgstr "Brake Axis（制动轴）"

#. Key:	FGearStandardInput:mBrakeAxis
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mBrakeAxis [NameProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mBrakeAxis [NameProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearStandardInput:mBrakeAxis"
msgid "If you uncheck UseCombinedAxis option you can assign an axis for braking with this. Range : [0, 1]."
msgstr "If you uncheck UseCombinedAxis option you can assign an axis for braking with this. Range : [0, 1].\n取消勾选 UseCombinedAxis（使用合并轴）后，可在此指定独立的制动输入轴。范围：[0, 1]。"

#. Key:	FGearStandardInput:mBrakeEngagement
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mBrakeEngagement [ObjectProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mBrakeEngagement [ObjectProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearStandardInput:mBrakeEngagement"
msgid "Brake Engagement"
msgstr "Brake Engagement（制动接合曲线）"

#. Key:	FGearStandardInput:mBrakeEngagement
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mBrakeEngagement [ObjectProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mBrakeEngagement [ObjectProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearStandardInput:mBrakeEngagement"
msgid "Brake input takes values between 0 and 1. If brake is fully pressed it is 1 and if it is not pressed at all then it is 0. This value changes linearly as you press the pedal. The brake input represents the X-Axis of this curve and the resulting value represents the real brake power ratio. Brake pedal behaviour changes from vehicle to vehicle so you can customise it with this curve. The default curve is a linear pedal."
msgstr "Brake input takes values between 0 and 1. If brake is fully pressed it is 1 and if it is not pressed at all then it is 0. This value changes linearly as you press the pedal. The brake input represents the X-Axis of this curve and the resulting value represents the real brake power ratio. Brake pedal behaviour changes from vehicle to vehicle so you can customise it with this curve. The default curve is a linear pedal.\n制动输入范围为 0 到 1：踏板完全踩下为 1，完全松开为 0，数值随踏板行程线性变化。制动输入对应曲线的 X 轴，曲线输出表示实际制动力比例。不同载具的制动踏板特性不同，可用此曲线自定义。默认曲线为线性踏板响应。"

#. Key:	FGearStandardInput:mBrakingDeadzone
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mBrakingDeadzone [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mBrakingDeadzone [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearStandardInput:mBrakingDeadzone"
msgid "Braking Deadzone"
msgstr "Braking Deadzone（制动死区）"

#. Key:	FGearStandardInput:mBrakingDeadzone
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mBrakingDeadzone [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mBrakingDeadzone [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearStandardInput:mBrakingDeadzone"
msgid "Input values below this value are discarded. A small dead zone is mostly usefull"
msgstr "Input values below this value are discarded. A small dead zone is mostly usefull\n低于此值的输入会被忽略。设置一个较小的死区通常很有用。"

#. Key:	FGearStandardInput:mBrakingRange
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mBrakingRange [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mBrakingRange [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearStandardInput:mBrakingRange"
msgid "Braking Range"
msgstr "Braking Range（制动范围）"

#. Key:	FGearStandardInput:mBrakingRange
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mBrakingRange [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mBrakingRange [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearStandardInput:mBrakingRange"
msgid "The percentage of braking range. Works similar to steering range"
msgstr "The percentage of braking range. Works similar to steering range\n制动范围的百分比。工作方式与转向范围类似。"

#. Key:	FGearStandardInput:mBrakingSensivity
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mBrakingSensivity [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mBrakingSensivity [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearStandardInput:mBrakingSensivity"
msgid "Braking Sensivity"
msgstr "Braking Sensivity（制动灵敏度）"

#. Key:	FGearStandardInput:mBrakingSensivity
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mBrakingSensivity [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mBrakingSensivity [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearStandardInput:mBrakingSensivity"
msgid "This determines how fast the braking value catches up with the input axis value. Higher values result sharper braking"
msgstr "This determines how fast the braking value catches up with the input axis value. Higher values result sharper braking\n决定制动值追随输入轴数值的速度。数值越大，制动响应越迅速。"

#. Key:	FGearStandardInput:mClutchAction
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mClutchAction [ObjectProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mClutchAction [ObjectProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearStandardInput:mClutchAction"
msgid "Clutch Action"
msgstr "Clutch Action（离合器输入动作）"

#. Key:	FGearStandardInput:mClutchAction
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mClutchAction [ObjectProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mClutchAction [ObjectProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearStandardInput:mClutchAction"
msgid "Input action that corresponds to mClutchAxis."
msgstr "Input action that corresponds to mClutchAxis.\n对应 mClutchAxis 的输入动作。"

#. Key:	FGearStandardInput:mClutchAxis
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mClutchAxis [NameProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mClutchAxis [NameProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearStandardInput:mClutchAxis"
msgid "Clutch Axis"
msgstr "Clutch Axis（离合器轴）"

#. Key:	FGearStandardInput:mClutchAxis
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mClutchAxis [NameProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mClutchAxis [NameProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearStandardInput:mClutchAxis"
msgid "Clutch axis for manual transmission. Range : [-1, 1] but internally normalized to [0,1]."
msgstr "Clutch axis for manual transmission. Range : [-1, 1] but internally normalized to [0,1].\n手动变速箱的离合器输入轴。范围为 [-1, 1]，但内部会归一化到 [0, 1]。"

#. Key:	FGearStandardInput:mClutchDeadzone
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mClutchDeadzone [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mClutchDeadzone [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearStandardInput:mClutchDeadzone"
msgid "Clutch Deadzone"
msgstr "Clutch Deadzone（离合器死区）"

#. Key:	FGearStandardInput:mClutchDeadzone
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mClutchDeadzone [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mClutchDeadzone [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearStandardInput:mClutchDeadzone"
msgid "Input values below this value are discarded. A small dead zone is mostly usefull."
msgstr "Input values below this value are discarded. A small dead zone is mostly usefull.\n低于此值的输入会被忽略。设置一个较小的死区通常很有用。"

#. Key:	FGearStandardInput:mClutchEngagement
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mClutchEngagement [ObjectProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mClutchEngagement [ObjectProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearStandardInput:mClutchEngagement"
msgid "Cluth Engagement"
msgstr "Cluth Engagement（离合器接合曲线）"

#. Key:	FGearStandardInput:mClutchEngagement
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mClutchEngagement [ObjectProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mClutchEngagement [ObjectProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearStandardInput:mClutchEngagement"
msgid "There is an internal variable called ClutchState which takes values between 0 and 1. If clutch is full pressed it is 1 and if it is not pressed at all then it is 0. This value changes linearly as you press the pedal. The ClutchState represents the X-Axis of this curve and the resulting value represent the real clutch power ratio. Clutch pedal behaviour changes from vehicle to vehicle but generally try to leave a dead zone before engaging and then quickly raise the power ratio. The default curve is a simple example to this"
msgstr "There is an internal variable called ClutchState which takes values between 0 and 1. If clutch is full pressed it is 1 and if it is not pressed at all then it is 0. This value changes linearly as you press the pedal. The ClutchState represents the X-Axis of this curve and the resulting value represent the real clutch power ratio. Clutch pedal behaviour changes from vehicle to vehicle but generally try to leave a dead zone before engaging and then quickly raise the power ratio. The default curve is a simple example to this\n内部变量 ClutchState 的范围为 0 到 1：离合器踏板完全踩下为 1，完全松开为 0，数值随踏板行程线性变化。ClutchState 对应曲线的 X 轴，曲线输出表示实际离合器动力比例。不同载具的离合器踏板特性不同，通常可在接合前留一段死区，再快速提高动力比例。默认曲线是这种设置的简单示例。"

#. Key:	FGearStandardInput:mClutchRange
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mClutchRange [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mClutchRange [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearStandardInput:mClutchRange"
msgid "Clutch Range"
msgstr "Clutch Range（离合器范围）"

#. Key:	FGearStandardInput:mClutchRange
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mClutchRange [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mClutchRange [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearStandardInput:mClutchRange"
msgid "The percentage of clutch range. Works similar to steering range"
msgstr "The percentage of clutch range. Works similar to steering range\n离合器范围的百分比。工作方式与转向范围类似。"

#. Key:	FGearStandardInput:mClutchSensivity
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mClutchSensivity [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mClutchSensivity [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearStandardInput:mClutchSensivity"
msgid "Clutch Sensivity"
msgstr "Clutch Sensivity（离合器灵敏度）"

#. Key:	FGearStandardInput:mClutchSensivity
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mClutchSensivity [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mClutchSensivity [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearStandardInput:mClutchSensivity"
msgid "This determines how fast the clutch value catches up with the input axis value. Higher values result sharper clutch engagement"
msgstr "This determines how fast the clutch value catches up with the input axis value. Higher values result sharper clutch engagement\n决定离合器值追随输入轴数值的速度。数值越大，离合器接合响应越迅速。"

#. Key:	FGearStandardInput:mCombinedAxis
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mCombinedAxis [BoolProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mCombinedAxis [BoolProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearStandardInput:mCombinedAxis"
msgid "Use Combined Axis"
msgstr "Use Combined Axis（使用合并轴）"

#. Key:	FGearStandardInput:mCombinedAxis
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mCombinedAxis [BoolProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mCombinedAxis [BoolProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearStandardInput:mCombinedAxis"
msgid "This applies only to throttle, brake and steering controls. If you want to use a combined axis like Vertical Axis for throttle/brake controls and Horizontal Axis for steering then enable this. If you want to use seperate axis for those then uncheck this option and setup proper axis values."
msgstr "This applies only to throttle, brake and steering controls. If you want to use a combined axis like Vertical Axis for throttle/brake controls and Horizontal Axis for steering then enable this. If you want to use seperate axis for those then uncheck this option and setup proper axis values.\n此选项仅适用于油门、制动和转向控制。若希望用合并轴控制，例如用垂直轴控制油门/制动、水平轴控制转向，请启用此项。若希望分别使用独立输入轴，请取消勾选，并设置对应的输入轴。"

#. Key:	FGearStandardInput:mControllerType
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mControllerType [EnumProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mControllerType [EnumProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearStandardInput:mControllerType"
msgid "Controller Type"
msgstr "Controller Type（控制器类型）"

#. Key:	FGearStandardInput:mControllerType
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mControllerType [EnumProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mControllerType [EnumProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearStandardInput:mControllerType"
msgid "Type of the controller : Keyboard, joystick or wheel. Most of the controls can work at the same time, for ex. even if you select keyboard you can play with joystick too."
msgstr "Type of the controller : Keyboard, joystick or wheel. Most of the controls can work at the same time, for ex. even if you select keyboard you can play with joystick too.\n控制器类型：键盘、摇杆或方向盘。大多数控制方式可以同时使用，例如选择键盘后通常仍可使用摇杆操作。"

