#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mSteeringAssist [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mSteeringAssist [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearStandardInput:mSteeringAssist"
msgid "Steering assist tries to steer towards the direction that the vehicle body travels."
msgstr "Steering assist tries to steer towards the direction that the vehicle body travels.\n转向辅助会尝试使车轮转向车身实际运动的方向。"

#. Key:	FGearStandardInput:mSteeringAssistThresholdAngle
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mSteeringAssistThresholdAngle [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mSteeringAssistThresholdAngle [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearStandardInput:mSteeringAssistThresholdAngle"
msgid "Steering Assist Threshold Angle"
msgstr "Steering Assist Threshold Angle（转向辅助阈值角）"

#. Key:	FGearStandardInput:mSteeringAssistThresholdAngle
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mSteeringAssistThresholdAngle [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mSteeringAssistThresholdAngle [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearStandardInput:mSteeringAssistThresholdAngle"
msgid "If the angle between the steering direction and the vehicles velocity direction is above this value, steering assist is activated."
msgstr "If the angle between the steering direction and the vehicles velocity direction is above this value, steering assist is activated.\n转向方向与载具速度方向的夹角超过此值时，启用转向辅助。"

#. Key:	FGearStandardInput:mSteerInputGravity
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mSteerInputGravity [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mSteerInputGravity [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearStandardInput:mSteerInputGravity"
msgid "Steer Input Gravity"
msgstr "Steer Input Gravity（转向输入回中）"

#. Key:	FGearStandardInput:mSteerInputGravity
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mSteerInputGravity [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mSteerInputGravity [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearStandardInput:mSteerInputGravity"
msgid "If the current steering angle and the desired steering angle have different signs than current steering speed is multiplied with this value. This lets user to counter steer more easily with the keyboard or joystick."
msgstr "If the current steering angle and the desired steering angle have different signs than current steering speed is multiplied with this value. This lets user to counter steer more easily with the keyboard or joystick.\n当前转向角与目标转向角符号相反时，当前转向速度会乘以此值，使用户更容易使用键盘或摇杆进行反打方向。"

#. Key:	FGearStandardInput:mSteerLimitCurve
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mSteerLimitCurve [ObjectProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mSteerLimitCurve [ObjectProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearStandardInput:mSteerLimitCurve"
msgid "Steer Limit Curve"
msgstr "Steer Limit Curve（转向限制曲线）"

#. Key:	FGearStandardInput:mSteerLimitCurve
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mSteerLimitCurve [ObjectProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mSteerLimitCurve [ObjectProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearStandardInput:mSteerLimitCurve"
msgid "If you want the maximum steering angle to be limited as the vehicle goes faster you can use this curve. The x-axis represents speed in kmh and the y-axis should be a value between 0 and 100. 100 means steering is not limited and 0 means no steering possible at all. The limit angle is calculated as (value/100) * MaxSteerAngle."
msgstr "If you want the maximum steering angle to be limited as the vehicle goes faster you can use this curve. The x-axis represents speed in kmh and the y-axis should be a value between 0 and 100. 100 means steering is not limited and 0 means no steering possible at all. The limit angle is calculated as (value/100) * MaxSteerAngle.\n如果希望随着车速提高限制最大转向角，可使用此曲线。X 轴为车速，单位为 km/h；Y 轴取值应为 0 到 100。100 表示不限制转向，0 表示完全无法转向。限制角度按（曲线值 / 100）× MaxSteerAngle 计算。"

#. Key:	FGearStandardInput:mSteerRange
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mSteerRange [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mSteerRange [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearStandardInput:mSteerRange"
msgid "Steer Range"
msgstr "Steer Range（转向范围）"

#. Key:	FGearStandardInput:mSteerRange
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mSteerRange [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mSteerRange [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearStandardInput:mSteerRange"
msgid "The percentage of steering range. For ex. if you set this to %10 then a %10 input will result %100 steering. Another example is that a steering wheel with 900 degress of working range needs 450 degrees of rotation to make a full turn but if this value is %10 then a 45 degrees of rotation will make a full turn."
msgstr "The percentage of steering range. For ex. if you set this to %10 then a %10 input will result %100 steering. Another example is that a steering wheel with 900 degress of working range needs 450 degrees of rotation to make a full turn but if this value is %10 then a 45 degrees of rotation will make a full turn.\n转向范围的百分比。例如设为 10% 时，10% 的输入即可产生 100% 的转向。又如工作范围为 900 度的方向盘，通常需要旋转 450 度才能打满方向；若此值为 10%，则旋转 45 度即可打满。"

#. Key:	FGearStandardInput:mSteerSensivity
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mSteerSensivity [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mSteerSensivity [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearStandardInput:mSteerSensivity"
msgid "Steer Sensivity"
msgstr "Steer Sensivity（转向灵敏度）"

#. Key:	FGearStandardInput:mSteerSensivity
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mSteerSensivity [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mSteerSensivity [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearStandardInput:mSteerSensivity"
msgid "If you want the steering speed to decrease as the vehicle goes faster you can use this curve. The x-axis represents speed in kmh and the y-axis is the steering speed"
msgstr "If you want the steering speed to decrease as the vehicle goes faster you can use this curve. The x-axis represents speed in kmh and the y-axis is the steering speed\n如果希望随着车速提高降低转向速度，可使用此曲线。X 轴为车速，单位为 km/h；Y 轴为转向速度。"

#. Key:	FGearStandardInput:mSteerSpeedCurve
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mSteerSpeedCurve [ObjectProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mSteerSpeedCurve [ObjectProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearStandardInput:mSteerSpeedCurve"
msgid "Steer Speed Curve"
msgstr "Steer Speed Curve（转向速度曲线）"

#. Key:	FGearStandardInput:mSteerSpeedCurve
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mSteerSpeedCurve [ObjectProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mSteerSpeedCurve [ObjectProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearStandardInput:mSteerSpeedCurve"
msgid "If you want the steering speed to decrease as the vehicle goes faster you can use this curve. The x-axis represents speed in kmh and the y-axis is the steering speed"
msgstr "If you want the steering speed to decrease as the vehicle goes faster you can use this curve. The x-axis represents speed in kmh and the y-axis is the steering speed\n如果希望随着车速提高降低转向速度，可使用此曲线。X 轴为车速，单位为 km/h；Y 轴为转向速度。"

#. Key:	FGearStandardInput:mThrottleAction
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mThrottleAction [ObjectProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mThrottleAction [ObjectProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearStandardInput:mThrottleAction"
msgid "Throttle Action"
msgstr "Throttle Action（油门输入动作）"

#. Key:	FGearStandardInput:mThrottleAction
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mThrottleAction [ObjectProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mThrottleAction [ObjectProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearStandardInput:mThrottleAction"
msgid "Input action that corresponds to mThrottleAxis."
msgstr "Input action that corresponds to mThrottleAxis.\n对应 mThrottleAxis 的输入动作。"

#. Key:	FGearStandardInput:mThrottleAxis
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mThrottleAxis [NameProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mThrottleAxis [NameProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearStandardInput:mThrottleAxis"
msgid "Throttle Axis"
msgstr "Throttle Axis（油门轴）"

#. Key:	FGearStandardInput:mThrottleAxis
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mThrottleAxis [NameProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mThrottleAxis [NameProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearStandardInput:mThrottleAxis"
msgid "If you uncheck UseCombinedAxis option you can assign an axis for throttle with this. Range : [0, 1]."
msgstr "If you uncheck UseCombinedAxis option you can assign an axis for throttle with this. Range : [0, 1].\n取消勾选 UseCombinedAxis（使用合并轴）后，可在此指定独立的油门输入轴。范围：[0, 1]。"

#. Key:	FGearStandardInput:mThrottleDeadzone
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mThrottleDeadzone [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mThrottleDeadzone [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearStandardInput:mThrottleDeadzone"
msgid "Throttle Deadzone"
msgstr "Throttle Deadzone（油门死区）"

#. Key:	FGearStandardInput:mThrottleDeadzone
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mThrottleDeadzone [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mThrottleDeadzone [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearStandardInput:mThrottleDeadzone"
msgid "Input values below this value are discarded. A small dead zone is mostly usefull"
msgstr "Input values below this value are discarded. A small dead zone is mostly usefull\n低于此值的输入会被忽略。设置一个较小的死区通常很有用。"

#. Key:	FGearStandardInput:mThrottleEngagement
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mThrottleEngagement [ObjectProperty DisplayName meta-data]
