#. Key:	FGearStandardInput:mThrottleSensivity
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mThrottleSensivity [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearStandardInput:mThrottleSensivity [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearStandardInput:mThrottleSensivity"
msgid "This determines how fast the throttle value catches up with the input axis value. Higher values result sharper throttle"
msgstr "This determines how fast the throttle value catches up with the input axis value. Higher values result sharper throttle\n决定油门值追随输入轴数值的速度。数值越大，油门响应越迅速。"

