msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearVehicle:mCenterofMass"
msgid "You can use multiple colliders with various sizes to achieve the desired effect which gives you the freedom to position center of mass as you like and usually you do not need to alter this setting. Center of mass has a dramatic effect on the handling of the vehicle so you can further tweak it with this parameter."
msgstr "You can use multiple colliders with various sizes to achieve the desired effect which gives you the freedom to position center of mass as you like and usually you do not need to alter this setting. Center of mass has a dramatic effect on the handling of the vehicle so you can further tweak it with this parameter.\n可以使用多个不同尺寸的碰撞体达到期望效果，从而自由调整质心位置，通常不必再改此项。质心对载具操控影响很大，也可用此参数进一步微调。"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mConvexAsset
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mConvexAsset [ObjectProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mConvexAsset [ObjectProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearVehicle:mConvexAsset"
msgid "Convex Cast Shape"
msgstr "Convex Cast Shape（凸体投射形状）"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mConvexAsset
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mConvexAsset [ObjectProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mConvexAsset [ObjectProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearVehicle:mConvexAsset"
msgid "Static mesh asset to be used for convex sweep queries. By default it is set to a simple cylinder mesh that is included in the plugin."
msgstr "Static mesh asset to be used for convex sweep queries. By default it is set to a simple cylinder mesh that is included in the plugin.\n凸体扫掠查询使用的静态网格体资源。默认使用插件自带的简单圆柱网格体。"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mConvexRotation
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mConvexRotation [StructProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mConvexRotation [StructProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearVehicle:mConvexRotation"
msgid "Convex Shape Rotation"
msgstr "Convex Shape Rotation（凸体形状旋转）"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mConvexRotation
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mConvexRotation [StructProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mConvexRotation [StructProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearVehicle:mConvexRotation"
msgid "The convex shape's local orientation is defined with this value."
msgstr "The convex shape's local orientation is defined with this value.\n此值定义凸体形状的局部朝向。"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mConvexUp
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mConvexUp [EnumProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mConvexUp [EnumProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearVehicle:mConvexUp"
msgid "Convex Shape Up"
msgstr "Convex Shape Up（凸体形状向上轴）"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mConvexUp
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mConvexUp [EnumProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mConvexUp [EnumProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearVehicle:mConvexUp"
msgid "The convex shape is scaled based on wheel radius and width. This value defines which axis will be scaled with the width of the wheel."
msgstr "The convex shape is scaled based on wheel radius and width. This value defines which axis will be scaled with the width of the wheel.\n凸体形状会根据车轮半径和宽度缩放。此值指定哪个轴按轮宽缩放。"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mConvexVisible
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mConvexVisible [BoolProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mConvexVisible [BoolProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearVehicle:mConvexVisible"
msgid "Convex Shape Visible"
msgstr "Convex Shape Visible（显示凸体形状）"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mConvexVisible
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mConvexVisible [BoolProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mConvexVisible [BoolProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearVehicle:mConvexVisible"
msgid "Can be used for debugging purposes, this lets you render the convex shape that is used for wheel queries."
msgstr "Can be used for debugging purposes, this lets you render the convex shape that is used for wheel queries.\n用于调试，可显示车轮查询所使用的凸体形状。"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mCustomGravity
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mCustomGravity [BoolProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mCustomGravity [BoolProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearVehicle:mCustomGravity"
msgid "Use Custom Gravity"
msgstr "Use Custom Gravity（使用自定义重力）"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mCustomGravity
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mCustomGravity [BoolProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mCustomGravity [BoolProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearVehicle:mCustomGravity"
msgid "When active disables physics engine gravity and uses the custom gravity vector to apply a custom acceleration."
msgstr "When active disables physics engine gravity and uses the custom gravity vector to apply a custom acceleration.\n启用后，关闭物理引擎自带重力，改用自定义重力向量施加加速度。"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mDefaultCylinderAsset
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mDefaultCylinderAsset [ObjectProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mDefaultCylinderAsset [ObjectProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearVehicle:mDefaultCylinderAsset"
msgid "M Default Cylinder Asset"
msgstr ""

#. Key:	FGearVehicle|Simulation
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mDetectGround [BoolProperty Category meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mDetectGround [BoolProperty Category meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectCategory,FGearVehicle|Simulation"
msgid "FGearVehicle|Simulation"
msgstr "FGearVehicle|Simulation（仿真）"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mDetectGround
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mDetectGround [BoolProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mDetectGround [BoolProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearVehicle:mDetectGround"
msgid "Detect Ground Velocity"
msgstr "Detect Ground Velocity（检测地面速度）"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mDetectGround
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mDetectGround [BoolProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mDetectGround [BoolProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearVehicle:mDetectGround"
msgid "If set the wheels will detect the velocity of the ground and take it into account when calculating velocity."
msgstr "If set the wheels will detect the velocity of the ground and take it into account when calculating velocity.\n启用后，车轮会检测地面速度，并在计算速度时将其计入。"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mDrivetrainFriction
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mDrivetrainFriction [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mDrivetrainFriction [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearVehicle:mDrivetrainFriction"
msgid "DrivetrainFriction"
msgstr "DrivetrainFriction（传动系统摩擦）"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mDrivetrainFriction
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mDrivetrainFriction [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mDrivetrainFriction [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearVehicle:mDrivetrainFriction"
msgid "Wheels decelerate based on effects like engine braking, rolling resistance and aerodynamic drag. This is another factor that resists the wheel rotation. Unlike rolling resistance this is a constant factor."
msgstr "Wheels decelerate based on effects like engine braking, rolling resistance and aerodynamic drag. This is another factor that resists the wheel rotation. Unlike rolling resistance this is a constant factor.\n发动机制动、滚动阻力和空气阻力等会使车轮减速。此值是另一个阻碍车轮旋转的因素，与滚动阻力不同，它是恒定因子。"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mDrivetrainInertia
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mDrivetrainInertia [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mDrivetrainInertia [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearVehicle:mDrivetrainInertia"
msgid "DrivetrainInertia"
msgstr "DrivetrainInertia（传动系统惯量）"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mDrivetrainInertia
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mDrivetrainInertia [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mDrivetrainInertia [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearVehicle:mDrivetrainInertia"
msgid "This used when calculating the acceleration/deceleration of the wheels based on applied torque. Higher inertia will result slower accelerations. This has an effect similar to wheel mass values."
msgstr "This used when calculating the acceleration/deceleration of the wheels based on applied torque. Higher inertia will result slower accelerations. This has an effect similar to wheel mass values.\n用于根据施加的扭矩计算车轮的加速与减速。惯量越高，加速越慢，效果与车轮质量参数相近。"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mEngine [ObjectProperty Category meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mEngine [ObjectProperty Category meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectCategory,FGearVehicle"
msgid "FGearVehicle"
msgstr "FGearVehicle（载具）"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mEngine
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mEngine [ObjectProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mEngine [ObjectProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearVehicle:mEngine"
msgid "Engine"
msgstr "Engine（发动机）"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mFrontAntiRollPower
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mFrontAntiRollPower [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mFrontAntiRollPower [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearVehicle:mFrontAntiRollPower"
msgid "Front Anti Roll Power"
msgstr "Front Anti Roll Power（前轴防倾力度）"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mFrontAntiRollPower
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mFrontAntiRollPower [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mFrontAntiRollPower [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearVehicle:mFrontAntiRollPower"
msgid "Anti roll bars help to reduce body roll during fast cornering. Front antirollbars help to reduce oversteering. This only works for 4 wheel vehicles"
msgstr "Anti roll bars help to reduce body roll during fast cornering. Front antirollbars help to reduce oversteering. This only works for 4 wheel vehicles\n防倾杆有助于减少高速转弯时的车身侧倾。前防倾杆有助于减少转向过度。仅适用于四轮载具。"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mGravity
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mGravity [StructProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mGravity [StructProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearVehicle:mGravity"
msgid "Gravity"
msgstr "Gravity（重力）"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mGravity
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mGravity [StructProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mGravity [StructProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearVehicle:mGravity"
msgid "Gravitational acceleration vector to be used when custom gravity is active."
msgstr "Gravitational acceleration vector to be used when custom gravity is active.\n启用自定义重力时使用的重力加速度向量。"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mHandBrakePower
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mHandBrakePower [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mHandBrakePower [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearVehicle:mHandBrakePower"
msgid "HandBrake Power"
msgstr "HandBrake Power（手刹力度）"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mHandBrakePower
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mHandBrakePower [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mHandBrakePower [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearVehicle:mHandBrakePower"
msgid "Normally brake powers are set per axle but if you want the rear wheels to lock quicker with handbrake you can increase this value. This has little to no effect on actual braking power but wheels lock more easily."
msgstr "Normally brake powers are set per axle but if you want the rear wheels to lock quicker with handbrake you can increase this value. This has little to no effect on actual braking power but wheels lock more easily.\n制动力通常按车轴设置。若希望后轮在使用手刹时更快抱死，可以增大此值。它对实际制动力几乎没有影响，但会让车轮更容易抱死。"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mHardContactScale
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mHardContactScale [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mHardContactScale [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearVehicle:mHardContactScale"
msgid "Suspension Hard Contact Scale"
msgstr "Suspension Hard Contact Scale（悬架硬接触缩放）"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mHardContactScale
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mHardContactScale [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mHardContactScale [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearVehicle:mHardContactScale"
msgid "If set the suspensions will generate an extra force after being fully compressed. This extra force will try to prevent the suspension from compressing more then its limit."
msgstr "If set the suspensions will generate an extra force after being fully compressed. This extra force will try to prevent the suspension from compressing more then its limit.\n启用后，悬架在完全压缩后会产生额外的力，尝试防止悬架继续压缩并超过极限。"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mIgnoreMask
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mIgnoreMask [ByteProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mIgnoreMask [ByteProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearVehicle:mIgnoreMask"
msgid "Query Ignore Mask"
msgstr "Query Ignore Mask（查询忽略遮罩）"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mIgnoreMask
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mIgnoreMask [ByteProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mIgnoreMask [ByteProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearVehicle:mIgnoreMask"
msgid "Extra filtering parameter of type FMaskFilter. This filter allows us to refine queries (channel, object) with an additional level of ignore by tagging entire classes of objects."
msgstr "Extra filtering parameter of type FMaskFilter. This filter allows us to refine queries (channel, object) with an additional level of ignore by tagging entire classes of objects.\n类型为 FMaskFilter 的额外过滤参数。此过滤器通过为整类对象添加标记，为通道或对象查询增加一层忽略过滤。"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mInertiaScale
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mInertiaScale [StructProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mInertiaScale [StructProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearVehicle:mInertiaScale"
msgid "Inertia Scale"
msgstr "Inertia Scale（惯量缩放）"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mInertiaScale
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mInertiaScale [StructProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mInertiaScale [StructProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearVehicle:mInertiaScale"
msgid "This value is a direct multiplier to the rigidbody inertia. Higher values result slower accelerations and more conservation of momentum. Experiment with it as you like."
msgstr "This value is a direct multiplier to the rigidbody inertia. Higher values result slower accelerations and more conservation of momentum. Experiment with it as you like.\n刚体惯量的直接乘数。数值越大，加速越慢，动量保持得越多，可按需要试验调整。"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mInSleep
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mInSleep [BoolProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mInSleep [BoolProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearVehicle:mInSleep"
msgid "M in Sleep"
msgstr ""

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mLateralRays
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mLateralRays [IntProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mLateralRays [IntProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearVehicle:mLateralRays"
msgid "Lateral Ray Count"
msgstr "Lateral Ray Count（横向射线数量）"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mLateralRays
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mLateralRays [IntProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mLateralRays [IntProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearVehicle:mLateralRays"
msgid "If you need a wheel with real width than setting this value to 2 or 3 will multiply the Ray Count value and the origins of raycasts are offset to left and right according to the wheel width. For a racing game its better to keep its value at 1."
msgstr "If you need a wheel with real width than setting this value to 2 or 3 will multiply the Ray Count value and the origins of raycasts are offset to left and right according to the wheel width. For a racing game its better to keep its value at 1.\n如果需要具有实际宽度的车轮，可将此值设为 2 或 3；它会使总射线数量按此倍数增加，并根据轮宽将射线起点向左右偏移。竞速游戏建议保持为 1。"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mMass
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mMass [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mMass [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearVehicle:mMass"
msgid "Mass"
msgstr "Mass（质量）"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mMass
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mMass [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mMass [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearVehicle:mMass"
msgid "This is the mass of the vehicle body in kilograms and this value is set as the mass of the rigidbody component. Keep it close to realistic values."
msgstr "This is the mass of the vehicle body in kilograms and this value is set as the mass of the rigidbody component. Keep it close to realistic values.\n车身质量，单位为千克。此值会设置为刚体组件的质量，应尽量接近真实数值。"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mMaxHillHolderSpeed
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mMaxHillHolderSpeed [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mMaxHillHolderSpeed [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearVehicle:mMaxHillHolderSpeed"
msgid "Max HillHolder Speed"
msgstr "Max HillHolder Speed（坡道保持最高速度）"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mMaxHillHolderSpeed
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mMaxHillHolderSpeed [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mMaxHillHolderSpeed [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearVehicle:mMaxHillHolderSpeed"
msgid "Hillholder holds the brake when the vehicle travel direction is against the current gear. It's only activated if the speed of the vehicle is below this value. Zero means disabled."
msgstr "Hillholder holds the brake when the vehicle travel direction is against the current gear. It's only activated if the speed of the vehicle is below this value. Zero means disabled.\n当载具行驶方向与当前挡位方向相反时，坡道保持功能会保持制动。仅在载具速度低于此值时启用；设为 0 表示禁用。"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mMesh
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mMesh [ObjectProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mMesh [ObjectProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearVehicle:mMesh"
msgid "Mesh"
msgstr "Mesh（网格体）"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mMinAbsSpeed
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mMinAbsSpeed [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mMinAbsSpeed [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearVehicle:mMinAbsSpeed"
msgid "Minumum ABS Speed"
msgstr "Minumum ABS Speed（ABS 最低速度）"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mMinAbsSpeed
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mMinAbsSpeed [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mMinAbsSpeed [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearVehicle:mMinAbsSpeed"
msgid "The antilock braking system will not be active below this speed."
msgstr "The antilock braking system will not be active below this speed.\n车速低于此值时，防抱死制动系统不启用。"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mMinOverSteerAngle
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mMinOverSteerAngle [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mMinOverSteerAngle [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearVehicle:mMinOverSteerAngle"
msgid "Min Over Steer Angle"
msgstr "Min Over Steer Angle（最小转向过度角）"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mMinOverSteerAngle
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mMinOverSteerAngle [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mMinOverSteerAngle [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearVehicle:mMinOverSteerAngle"
msgid "If the angle between the steering direction and the vehicles velocity direction is above this value, over steer assist is activated"
msgstr "If the angle between the steering direction and the vehicles velocity direction is above this value, over steer assist is activated\n转向方向与载具速度方向的夹角超过此值时，启用转向过度辅助。"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mMinUnderSteerAngle
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mMinUnderSteerAngle [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mMinUnderSteerAngle [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearVehicle:mMinUnderSteerAngle"
msgid "Min Under Steer Angle"
msgstr "Min Under Steer Angle（最小转向不足角）"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mMinUnderSteerAngle
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mMinUnderSteerAngle [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mMinUnderSteerAngle [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearVehicle:mMinUnderSteerAngle"
msgid "If the angle between the steering direction and the vehicles velocity direction is above this value, under steer assist is activated."
msgstr "If the angle between the steering direction and the vehicles velocity direction is above this value, under steer assist is activated.\n转向方向与载具速度方向的夹角超过此值时，启用转向不足辅助。"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mOptimumSlipWeight
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mOptimumSlipWeight [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mOptimumSlipWeight [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearVehicle:mOptimumSlipWeight"
msgid "Optimum Slip Weight"
msgstr "Optimum Slip Weight（最佳滑移权重）"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mOptimumSlipWeight
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mOptimumSlipWeight [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mOptimumSlipWeight [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearVehicle:mOptimumSlipWeight"
msgid "Experimental feature, use with caution. Optimum slip is the value at which the tire generates the greatest friction force. This basically adjusts the slip ratio to prevent it from going below the optimum value. The result is that the engine rpm and the wheel speeds will be at perfect match but having a constant slip value can effect the overall lateral traction too."
msgstr "Experimental feature, use with caution. Optimum slip is the value at which the tire generates the greatest friction force. This basically adjusts the slip ratio to prevent it from going below the optimum value. The result is that the engine rpm and the wheel speeds will be at perfect match but having a constant slip value can effect the overall lateral traction too.\n试验性功能，请谨慎使用。最佳滑移是轮胎产生最大摩擦力时的滑移值。此功能调整滑移率，防止其低于最佳值，使发动机转速与车轮转速完全匹配；但保持恒定滑移值也会影响整体横向抓地力。"

