#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mOverSteerAssist [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearVehicle:mOverSteerAssist"
msgid "Over Steer Assist"
msgstr "Over Steer Assist（转向过度辅助）"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mOverSteerAssist
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mOverSteerAssist [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mOverSteerAssist [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearVehicle:mOverSteerAssist"
msgid "Helps to prevent oversteering by using brakes like an esp system. This only works for 4 wheel vehicles"
msgstr "Helps to prevent oversteering by using brakes like an esp system. This only works for 4 wheel vehicles\n类似 ESP 系统，通过制动帮助抑制转向过度。仅适用于四轮载具。"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mQueryMobilityType
