#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mQueryType [EnumProperty Category meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectCategory,FGearVehicle|Tracing"
msgid "FGearVehicle|Tracing"
msgstr "FGearVehicle|Tracing（碰撞查询）"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mQueryType
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mQueryType [EnumProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mQueryType [EnumProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearVehicle:mQueryType"
msgid "Query Type"
msgstr "Query Type（查询类型）"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mQueryType
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mQueryType [EnumProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mQueryType [EnumProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearVehicle:mQueryType"
msgid "Line tracing uses regular raycasting approach. Sphere casting uses a sphere collider to make a sweep test. Both approaches have up and down sides."
msgstr "Line tracing uses regular raycasting approach. Sphere casting uses a sphere collider to make a sweep test. Both approaches have up and down sides.\n线段追踪采用常规射线检测；球体投射则使用球形碰撞体进行扫掠测试。两种方法各有优缺点。"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mRays
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mRays [IntProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mRays [IntProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearVehicle:mRays"
msgid "Ray Count"
msgstr "Ray Count（射线数量）"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mRays
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mRays [IntProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mRays [IntProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearVehicle:mRays"
msgid "This represents the number of rays that are casted for each wheel. If you need a 3d wheel effect you can increase this value. Keep in mind that the higher number of raycasts, the worse performance you get. For a racing game its better to keep its value at 1."
msgstr "This represents the number of rays that are casted for each wheel. If you need a 3d wheel effect you can increase this value. Keep in mind that the higher number of raycasts, the worse performance you get. For a racing game its better to keep its value at 1.\n每个车轮投射的射线数量。若需要三维车轮效果，可以提高此值，但射线越多，性能越差。竞速游戏建议保持为 1。"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mReactionScale
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mReactionScale [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mReactionScale [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearVehicle:mReactionScale"
msgid "Wheel Reaction Force Scale"
msgstr "Wheel Reaction Force Scale（车轮反作用力缩放）"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mReactionScale
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mReactionScale [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mReactionScale [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearVehicle:mReactionScale"
msgid "Tires generate friction forces to move the vehicle and suspensions generate forces to keep the vehicle away from ground. If you want the generated forces to be applied back to dynamic objects in your world then set this variable to 1. Sometimes generated forces are too large for objects with low mass so you can use a smaller value instead."
msgstr "Tires generate friction forces to move the vehicle and suspensions generate forces to keep the vehicle away from ground. If you want the generated forces to be applied back to dynamic objects in your world then set this variable to 1. Sometimes generated forces are too large for objects with low mass so you can use a smaller value instead.\n轮胎产生摩擦力推动载具，悬架产生支撑力使载具离开地面。若希望这些力反向作用到场景中的动态物体上，将此值设为 1。有时这些力对质量较小的物体过大，可改用较小值。"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mRearAntiRollPower
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mRearAntiRollPower [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mRearAntiRollPower [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearVehicle:mRearAntiRollPower"
msgid "Rear Anti Roll Power"
msgstr "Rear Anti Roll Power（后轴防倾力度）"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mRearAntiRollPower
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mRearAntiRollPower [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mRearAntiRollPower [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearVehicle:mRearAntiRollPower"
msgid "Rear anti rollbars help to reduce understeering. This only works for 4 wheel vehicles."
msgstr "Rear anti rollbars help to reduce understeering. This only works for 4 wheel vehicles.\n后防倾杆有助于减少转向不足。仅适用于四轮载具。"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mRelaxationDownforce
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mRelaxationDownforce [BoolProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mRelaxationDownforce [BoolProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearVehicle:mRelaxationDownforce"
msgid "Suspension Relaxation Downforce"
msgstr "Suspension Relaxation Downforce（悬架回弹下压力）"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mRelaxationDownforce
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mRelaxationDownforce [BoolProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mRelaxationDownforce [BoolProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearVehicle:mRelaxationDownforce"
msgid "If this is checked the relaxation damper can generate forces that pulls the vehicle towards the ground. This is mostly unnoticable at low values but if you provide a large value to relexation damper then you can observe that the vehicle will tend to stick to the ground even on bumpy surfaces. This is unrealistic but can be useful in certain cases where you need stable vehicles on rough terrain."
msgstr "If this is checked the relaxation damper can generate forces that pulls the vehicle towards the ground. This is mostly unnoticable at low values but if you provide a large value to relexation damper then you can observe that the vehicle will tend to stick to the ground even on bumpy surfaces. This is unrealistic but can be useful in certain cases where you need stable vehicles on rough terrain.\n勾选后，回弹阻尼可以产生将载具拉向地面的力。数值较小时通常不明显，但回弹阻尼很大时，载具即使在颠簸路面上也会倾向于贴住地面。这不符合真实物理，但在需要载具于粗糙地形上保持稳定时可能有用。"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mReplication
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mReplication [ObjectProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mReplication [ObjectProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearVehicle:mReplication"
msgid "Replication"
msgstr "Replication（网络同步）"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mResponseOverrides
