#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mResponseOverrides [MapProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearVehicle:mResponseOverrides"
msgid "Query Response Overrides"
msgstr "Query Response Overrides（查询响应覆盖）"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mResponseOverrides
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mResponseOverrides [MapProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mResponseOverrides [MapProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearVehicle:mResponseOverrides"
msgid "This only works with line & sphere tracing. By default all channel responses are set to blocked, if you want to modify a channel response you can add an override to this list."
msgstr "This only works with line & sphere tracing. By default all channel responses are set to blocked, if you want to modify a channel response you can add an override to this list.\n仅对线段和球体追踪有效。默认所有通道的响应都设为阻挡；若要修改某通道的响应，可在此列表中添加覆盖项。"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mReverseBrakeSpeed
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mReverseBrakeSpeed [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mReverseBrakeSpeed [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearVehicle:mReverseBrakeSpeed"
msgid "Reverse Brake Speed"
msgstr "Reverse Brake Speed（反向制动速度）"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mReverseBrakeSpeed
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mReverseBrakeSpeed [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mReverseBrakeSpeed [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearVehicle:mReverseBrakeSpeed"
msgid "If the vehicles intended moving direction does not match its velocity the vehicle will automatically brake when the current speed is above this value. For ex. the vehicle is in first gear but it is moving backwards, when you press the throttle it will engage the brakes for you. The same goes for the reverse gear. This will be disabled when zero."
msgstr "If the vehicles intended moving direction does not match its velocity the vehicle will automatically brake when the current speed is above this value. For ex. the vehicle is in first gear but it is moving backwards, when you press the throttle it will engage the brakes for you. The same goes for the reverse gear. This will be disabled when zero.\n如果载具期望行驶方向与实际速度方向不一致，且当前速度高于此值，载具会自动制动。例如载具处于一挡但正在后退，此时踩油门会自动施加制动；倒挡时同理。设为 0 时禁用。"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mSleepAngularThreshold
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mSleepAngularThreshold [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mSleepAngularThreshold [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
