msgstr "The minimum linear velocity(km/h) threshold required for the vehicle to enter sleep mode\n载具进入休眠模式所需的最低线速度阈值，单位为 km/h。"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mSleepWaitingTime
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mSleepWaitingTime [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mSleepWaitingTime [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearVehicle:mSleepWaitingTime"
