#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mStickyTireSpeed
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mStickyTireSpeed [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mStickyTireSpeed [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearVehicle:mStickyTireSpeed"
msgid "Sticky Tire Max Speed"
msgstr "Sticky Tire Max Speed（低速黏附最高速度）"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mStickyTireSpeed
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mStickyTireSpeed [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mStickyTireSpeed [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearVehicle:mStickyTireSpeed"
msgid "Pacejka tire model does not work well at low speeds. When the velocity gets too small the calculations get problematic so tires can slide slowly on a slope even if the vehicle is fully stopped. This is an experimental hacky solution to solve this issue. When the vehicles velocity is below this speed(kmh) the tires will switch to sticky state. If you keep this value at 0 then it is disabled."
msgstr "Pacejka tire model does not work well at low speeds. When the velocity gets too small the calculations get problematic so tires can slide slowly on a slope even if the vehicle is fully stopped. This is an experimental hacky solution to solve this issue. When the vehicles velocity is below this speed(kmh) the tires will switch to sticky state. If you keep this value at 0 then it is disabled.\nPacejka 轮胎模型在低速下表现不佳。速度过低时计算会出现问题，因此载具即使完全停住，轮胎仍可能在斜坡上缓慢滑动。这是一种试验性的变通方案：车速低于此值（单位：km/h）时，轮胎切换到黏附状态。设为 0 时禁用。"

