#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mTirePenetration
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mTirePenetration [BoolProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mTirePenetration [BoolProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearVehicle:mTirePenetration"
msgid "Suspension Tire Penetration"
msgstr "Suspension Tire Penetration（悬架轮胎穿透）"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mTirePenetration
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mTirePenetration [BoolProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mTirePenetration [BoolProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearVehicle:mTirePenetration"
msgid "It is not always possible to keep the suspension compression within limits. If the suspension is compressed beyond its limits then there are two possibilities. If this is checked the tires will penetrate the ground else the tires will stay on ground but can penetrate the fenders."
msgstr "It is not always possible to keep the suspension compression within limits. If the suspension is compressed beyond its limits then there are two possibilities. If this is checked the tires will penetrate the ground else the tires will stay on ground but can penetrate the fenders.\n悬架压缩量并不总能保持在极限范围内。若压缩超过极限，会有两种情况：勾选时轮胎会穿透地面；不勾选时轮胎会留在地面上，但可能穿透翼子板。"

#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mTraceChannel
