#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mUpdateRate [IntProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearVehicle:mUpdateRate"
msgid "This parameter sets the update frequency of the vehicles so even if the frame rate is 60hz and the update rate is 300hz then the system makes 5 sub steps to make sure you will get a 300hz update rate."
msgstr "This parameter sets the update frequency of the vehicles so even if the frame rate is 60hz and the update rate is 300hz then the system makes 5 sub steps to make sure you will get a 300hz update rate.\n设置载具的更新频率。例如帧率为 60 Hz、更新频率为 300 Hz 时，系统会执行 5 个子步，以保证达到 300 Hz 的更新频率。"

