#. Key:	FGearVehicle:mWheelFrictionCoeff
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mWheelFrictionCoeff [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearVehicle:mWheelFrictionCoeff [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearVehicle:mWheelFrictionCoeff"
msgid "This is the inherent friction factor of wheels. Applied friction force increases linearly as the wheels rotate faster. You may adjust it to limit the maximum speed but be aware that it also decreases the acceleration of the vehicle"
msgstr "This is the inherent friction factor of wheels. Applied friction force increases linearly as the wheels rotate faster. You may adjust it to limit the maximum speed but be aware that it also decreases the acceleration of the vehicle\n车轮固有的摩擦因数。车轮转得越快，施加的摩擦力线性增大。可用来限制最高速度，但也会降低载具的加速能力。"

