msgid "Radius"
msgstr "Radius（半径）"

#. Key:	FGearWheelOptions:mRadius
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearWheelOptions:mRadius [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearWheelOptions:mRadius [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearWheelOptions:mRadius"
msgid "Radius of the wheel in meters. You can see the resulting circle in the editor mode and in the play mode if you enable gizmos"
msgstr "Radius of the wheel in meters. You can see the resulting circle in the editor mode and in the play mode if you enable gizmos\n车轮半径，单位为米。启用辅助图形后，可在编辑和运行模式中看到对应的圆形。"

#. Key:	FGearWheelOptions:mRelaxationDamper
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearWheelOptions:mRelaxationDamper [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearWheelOptions:mRelaxationDamper [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearWheelOptions:mRelaxationDamper"
msgid "Relaxation Damper (N/ms)"
msgstr "Relaxation Damper (N/ms)（回弹阻尼）"

#. Key:	FGearWheelOptions:mRelaxationDamper
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearWheelOptions:mRelaxationDamper [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearWheelOptions:mRelaxationDamper [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearWheelOptions:mRelaxationDamper"
msgid "Suspension relaxation damper force per 1 ms velocity. This value is used when suspension is compressing and it absorbs some of the spring force and reduces suspension oscillations. Also see \"Suspension Relaxation Downforce\""
msgstr "Suspension relaxation damper force per 1 ms velocity. This value is used when suspension is compressing and it absorbs some of the spring force and reduces suspension oscillations. Also see \"Suspension Relaxation Downforce\"\n悬架每单位速度（m/s）对应的回弹阻尼力。悬架压缩时使用此值，以吸收部分弹簧力并减少悬架振荡。另请参阅“Suspension Relaxation Downforce（悬架回弹下压力）”。"

#. Key:	FGearWheelOptions:mRimOffset
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearWheelOptions:mRimOffset [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearWheelOptions:mRimOffset [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearWheelOptions:mRimOffset"
msgid "Rim Offset"
msgstr "Rim Offset（轮辋偏移）"

#. Key:	FGearWheelOptions:mRimOffset
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearWheelOptions:mRimOffset [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearWheelOptions:mRimOffset [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearWheelOptions:mRimOffset"
msgid "This is a lateral offset to the wheel rim. If your wheel position does not match with the physical wheel position you can adjust by using this value. You can activate gizmos from telemetry settings to see if your physical wheels match your wheel models."
msgstr "This is a lateral offset to the wheel rim. If your wheel position does not match with the physical wheel position you can adjust by using this value. You can activate gizmos from telemetry settings to see if your physical wheels match your wheel models.\n轮辋的横向偏移。如果车轮模型位置与物理车轮位置不一致，可用此值调整。可在遥测设置中启用辅助图形，检查物理车轮与车轮模型是否对齐。"

#. Key:	FGearWheelOptions:mRollMomentScale
