msgstr "The final Z-Axis moment is multiplied with this\n最终的 Z 轴力矩乘以此值。"

#. Key:	FGearWheelOptions:mSpacerOffset
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearWheelOptions:mSpacerOffset [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearWheelOptions:mSpacerOffset [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearWheelOptions:mSpacerOffset"
msgid "Spacer Offset"
msgstr "Spacer Offset（轮距垫片偏移）"

#. Key:	FGearWheelOptions:mSpacerOffset
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearWheelOptions:mSpacerOffset [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearWheelOptions:mSpacerOffset [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearWheelOptions:mSpacerOffset"
msgid "A positive spacer offset(in meters) will move the wheels away from each other resulting a wider track."
msgstr "A positive spacer offset(in meters) will move the wheels away from each other resulting a wider track.\n正的轮距垫片偏移（单位：米）会使两侧车轮彼此远离，从而增大轮距。"

#. Key:	FGearWheelOptions:mSuspensionDownTravel
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearWheelOptions:mSuspensionDownTravel [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearWheelOptions:mSuspensionDownTravel [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearWheelOptions:mSuspensionDownTravel"
msgid "Down Travel"
msgstr "Down Travel（下行程）"

#. Key:	FGearWheelOptions:mSuspensionDownTravel
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearWheelOptions:mSuspensionDownTravel [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearWheelOptions:mSuspensionDownTravel [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearWheelOptions:mSuspensionDownTravel"
msgid "This is the maximum distance in meters that your suspension will extend after the default pose. This value is the one that will effect the visible ride height"
msgstr "This is the maximum distance in meters that your suspension will extend after the default pose. This value is the one that will effect the visible ride height\n悬架从默认姿态继续伸展的最大距离，单位为米。此值会影响可见的车身高度。"

#. Key:	FGearWheelOptions:mSuspensionPreload
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearWheelOptions:mSuspensionPreload [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearWheelOptions:mSuspensionPreload [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearWheelOptions:mSuspensionPreload"
msgid "Preload(%)"
msgstr "Preload(%)（预载）"

#. Key:	FGearWheelOptions:mSuspensionPreload
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearWheelOptions:mSuspensionPreload [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearWheelOptions:mSuspensionPreload [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearWheelOptions:mSuspensionPreload"
msgid "This is the percentage of suspension length that is already compressed while it is fully extended"
msgstr "This is the percentage of suspension length that is already compressed while it is fully extended\n悬架完全伸展时，弹簧已经预先压缩的长度占悬架长度的百分比。"

#. Key:	FGearWheelOptions:mSuspensionSpring
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearWheelOptions:mSuspensionSpring [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearWheelOptions:mSuspensionSpring [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearWheelOptions:mSuspensionSpring"
msgid "Spring Rate (N/mm)"
msgstr "Spring Rate (N/mm)（弹簧刚度）"

#. Key:	FGearWheelOptions:mSuspensionSpring
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearWheelOptions:mSuspensionSpring [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearWheelOptions:mSuspensionSpring [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearWheelOptions:mSuspensionSpring"
msgid "Suspension spring force per mm, total force is SpringRate x TotalLength.  If your spring rate is not sufficient then you can not get the desired ride height so you are recommended to open telemetry gui and tweak accordingly"
msgstr "Suspension spring force per mm, total force is SpringRate x TotalLength.  If your spring rate is not sufficient then you can not get the desired ride height so you are recommended to open telemetry gui and tweak accordingly\n悬架每毫米行程对应的弹簧力，总力为弹簧刚度 × 总长度。若弹簧刚度不足，就无法获得期望的车身高度，建议打开遥测界面并据此调整。"

#. Key:	FGearWheelOptions|Suspension
