msgctxt "UObjectCategory,FGearWheelOptions|Tire"
msgid "FGearWheelOptions|Tire"
msgstr "FGearWheelOptions|Tire（轮胎）"

#. Key:	FGearWheelOptions:mTireModelClass
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearWheelOptions:mTireModelClass [ClassProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearWheelOptions:mTireModelClass [ClassProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearWheelOptions:mTireModelClass"
msgid "Tire Model"
msgstr "Tire Model（轮胎模型）"

#. Key:	FGearWheelOptions:mTireModelClass
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearWheelOptions:mTireModelClass [ClassProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearWheelOptions:mTireModelClass [ClassProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearWheelOptions:mTireModelClass"
msgid "This is a reference to the TireModel object that is used for calculating wheel forces. This list will only include the tiremodels that are found in the scene and all tiremodel prefabs can be found in Resources/Tires folder. If you want to try another tiremodel just drag&drop it to the scene and its name will appear in this combobox. Warning : If different tire models are added or removed from the scene this value may change automatically because internally this is an index value of the tire list and when the tire list changes your tire model might be changed too. The best practive is to add all the tiremodels to the scene and do not remove any even if you do not use them."
msgstr "This is a reference to the TireModel object that is used for calculating wheel forces. This list will only include the tiremodels that are found in the scene and all tiremodel prefabs can be found in Resources/Tires folder. If you want to try another tiremodel just drag&drop it to the scene and its name will appear in this combobox. Warning : If different tire models are added or removed from the scene this value may change automatically because internally this is an index value of the tire list and when the tire list changes your tire model might be changed too. The best practive is to add all the tiremodels to the scene and do not remove any even if you do not use them.\n用于计算车轮力的 TireModel 对象引用。列表只包含场景中找到的轮胎模型，所有轮胎模型预制件可在 Resources/Tires 文件夹中找到。若想尝试其他轮胎模型，将其拖入场景，其名称便会出现在此下拉列表中。注意：在场景中添加或移除轮胎模型可能自动改变此值，因为内部保存的是轮胎列表索引，列表变化时所选模型也可能改变。建议将全部轮胎模型加入场景，即使未使用也不要移除。"

#. Key:	FGearWheelOptions:mTirePressure
