#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearWheelOptions:mTirePressure [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearWheelOptions:mTirePressure"
msgid "Inflation pressure of tire in bars. This is only used by MF6.1 tire model."
msgstr "Inflation pressure of tire in bars. This is only used by MF6.1 tire model.\n轮胎充气压力，单位为 bar。仅供 MF6.1 轮胎模型使用。"

#. Key:	FGearWheelOptions:mVerticalOffset
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearWheelOptions:mVerticalOffset [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearWheelOptions:mVerticalOffset [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
