msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearWheelOptions:mVerticalOffset"
msgid "A positive vertical offset(in meters) will move the wheels towards +Z direction in local space."
msgstr "A positive vertical offset(in meters) will move the wheels towards +Z direction in local space.\n正的垂直偏移（单位：米）会使车轮沿局部空间的 +Z 方向移动。"

#. Key:	FGearWheelOptions:mWidth
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearWheelOptions:mWidth [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearWheelOptions:mWidth [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,FGearWheelOptions:mWidth"
msgid "Width"
msgstr "Width（宽度）"

#. Key:	FGearWheelOptions:mWidth
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/FGearPlugin.FGearWheelOptions:mWidth [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/FGearPlugin.FGearWheelOptions:mWidth [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,FGearWheelOptions:mWidth"
msgid "Wheels do not have real width in this system but the width(in meters) parameter is integrated to effect one thing. If you set lateral ray count to 2 or 3 then the distance between the rays are calculated using the width value. The best practice is to use realistic values and you can preview the tire width with the gizmos drawn"
msgstr "Wheels do not have real width in this system but the width(in meters) parameter is integrated to effect one thing. If you set lateral ray count to 2 or 3 then the distance between the rays are calculated using the width value. The best practice is to use realistic values and you can preview the tire width with the gizmos drawn\n此系统中的车轮没有实际宽度，但宽度参数（单位：米）用于一个方面：横向射线数量设为 2 或 3 时，射线间距根据轮宽计算。建议使用真实数值，并通过绘制的辅助图形预览轮胎宽度。"

